OL,3,GNEWSAThe day celebrated cosmonaut paid
OL,4,AManchester a visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou could easily miss it, but a small
OL,7,Fblack plaque sits in a corner of the
OL,8,Farrivals hall at Manchester Airport's
OL,9,FTerminal 3 to commemorate one of
OL,10,Fhumanity's greatest achievements.
OL,12,FIt marks the incredible journey of
OL,13,FSoviet cosmonaut Yuri Gagarin, who
OL,14,Ffamously became the first person in
OL,15,Fspace 65 years ago.
OL,17,FOn 12 April 1961, his Vostok spacecraft
OL,18,Fcompleted a single orbit of the Earth
OL,19,Fat the height of the so-called space
OL,20,Frace, as Russia and the US competed to
OL,21,Fmake the first daring leaps beyond the
OL,22,Fheavens.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
