OL,3,GNEWSAThe day celebrated cosmonaut paid
OL,4,AManchester a visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust three months later, Gagarin
OL,7,Fvisited Manchester to be greeted by
OL,8,Frapturous crowds as part of a world
OL,9,Ftour on 12 July 1961. His visit is the
OL,10,Fsubject of a new episode of Hidden
OL,11,FManchester on BBC Sounds.
